{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52931","headline":"与林元籍郊行举对（题拟） · 郑虔","name":"与林元籍郊行举对（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石压笋斜出。\n（虔）谷阴花後开。\n（元籍）（见《全浙诗话》卷五引《三台诗话》）（〖1〗《三台诗话》云：「郑司户虔初至台，见风俗朴野，选民间子弟教之。\n一日与弟子林元籍辈郊行，举一对曰〖略〗。\n元籍应声云〖略〗。\n司户大惊异曰：何教化神速如是。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑虔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}